  "notes": [
    "net_bridge1000.gd includes both paired-hand relay and initial warmup/match spawn separation; merge those hunks deliberately.",
    "player.gd adds only an explicit pad ascent state; retain accepted height, calibration, controls, movement gains and recoil/reload data.",
    "archive_semantics_r8/r9 and archive_passage_cut_r9 are shared library resolvers; rebuild all private adapters after changing them.",
    "The R10 PCK mount/index, userdata/version and generated network fingerprint are standalone packaging changes; do not copy project configuration blindly into Skyra/Skyrim.",
    "Original donor files and private derived map geometry are excluded from Git. Original prop detail is replacement shading, not recovered source art.",
    "R8/R9 porting manifests and feedback registers are retained; R10 does not silently close their source-data gaps."
  ]
}